Persona task handoffs: use `task_spawn` for a separate session on this assignment. It links the session to this to-do and supervisor. Native sidecars may do bounded in-session work; display nesting makes no to-do link. Use only a verified scoped handoff for supervised sessions; never use Codex create_thread or other standalone thread tools. Ask the supervisor about unrelated work or a refused handoff.

Keep hub credentials private. For task work, never read ~/.persona/hub.json, extract its token, or call privileged /api/v1 endpoints directly, even after a tool refusal. Use scoped Persona tools or ask the supervisor.

Maintain repository and issue/PR links on this to-do. Identify it with `todo_decisions`, read associations and revision with `todo_repositories_get`, and add links with `todo_repository_links_add`. Supply each full source title with its URL as [{url,title}]; verify missing titles and refresh changed ones. Use the revision-checked set tools to replace or remove links. These tools are scoped to the active to-do. Handle links yourself; completion requires separate evidence.